{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-01-12 12:31:00', 'title': 'KROGER HEALTH WINS 2022 AMERICAN PHARMACISTS ASSOCIATION IMMUNIZATION CHAMPION AWARD', 'text': 'CINCINNATI, JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0KROGER HEALTH, THE HEALTHCARE DIVISION OF THE KROGER CO. (NYSE:\xa0KR), RECEIVES THE 2022 AMERICAN PHARMACISTS ASSOCIATION (APHA) IMMUNIZATION CHAMPION AWARD. THE AWARD RECOGNIZES INDIVIDUALS AND ORGANIZATIONS MAKING EXTRAORDINARY CONTRIBUTIONS TOWARD IMPROVED VACCINATION RATES WITHIN THEIR COMMUNITIES.'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-01-12 09:15:00', 'title': 'KROGER AND NURO ANNOUNCE EXPANDED COLLABORATION, SHOWCASING NEW AUTONOMOUS VEHICLES SET TO POWER GROCERY DELIVERY SERVICE', 'text': "CINCINNATI AND MOUNTAIN VIEW, CALIF., JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) AND NURO ANNOUNCED TODAY AN EXPANDED COLLABORATION TO CONTINUE REDEFINING THE CUSTOMER EXPERIENCE LEVERAGING AUTONOMOUS VEHICLES WITH THE INTRODUCTION OF NURO'S THIRD-GENERATION AUTONOMOUS DELIVERY VEHICLE."}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-01-12 07:17:00', 'title': 'KING SOOPERS AND CITY MARKET OPEN FOR CUSTOMERS', 'text': 'DENVER, JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TODAY, KING SOOPERS AND CITY MARKET CALLED THE DECISION BY UFCW LOCAL 7 TO STRIKE RECKLESS AND SELF-SERVING, WITHOUT REGARD FOR THE IMPLICATIONS TO ASSOCIATES AND COLORADANS. "LOCAL 7 IS PUTTING POLITICS BEFORE PEOPLE AND PREVENTING US FROM PUTTING MORE MONEY IN OUR ASSOCIATES\' POCKETS," SAID JOE KELLEY, PRESIDENT OF KING SOOPERS AND CITY MARKET.'}{'symbol': 'KR', 'date': '2022-01-12 06:38:00', 'title': "ANALYSIS SHOWS THE KROGER CO.'S SUPERMARKET DIVISIONS IN WESTERN STATES PAYS HOURLY ASSOCIATES MORE THAN THEIR PEERS IN THE RETAIL INDUSTRY OVERALL", 'text': "CINCINNATI, JAN. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0TODAY, THE KROGER CO. (NYSE: KR) RELEASED AN ANALYSIS, KROGER STORES BENEFIT WESTERN COMMUNITIES: AN ASSESSMENT OF THE ENTERPRISE'S COMPENSATION PACKAGES AND THE ECONOMIC IMPACTS IN THE WEST \xa0THAT DOCUMENTS THE ORGANIZATION'S COMPENSATION OF ITS NEARLY 85,000 HOURLY ASSOCIATES IN FOUR WESTERN STATES: CALIFORNIA, COLORADO, OREGON, AND WASHINGTON. THE NDP | ANALYTICS REPORT, COMMISSIONED BY THE KROGER FAMILY OF COMPANIES, HIGHLIGHTS THE ROBUST ECONOMIC AND SOCIAL CONTRIBUTIONS KROGER MAKES TO THESE FOUR STATES, INCLUDING NOTEWORTHY EMPLOYMENT OF – AND OPPORTUNITIES FOR – COMMUNITIES OF COLOR AND LOWER-INCOME POPULATIONS."}